From 1d29675a1ab4c9cead1b22169482ba745ac61b91 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Guilherme Silva <239806034+NoneSilva@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 02:17:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(lm): bind the MCP server to loopback

The server called app.listen(port) with no host, so Node bound every interface,
and POST /mcp has no authentication. The new setting tlaplus.mcp.host chooses
the bind address, and the default is localhost. The scope of the setting is
machine. Only user or remote settings can change it, so opening a workspace
cannot open the port. The advertised URL uses the same name, so the client and
the server resolve it in the same way. The tests connect to the address the
server bound. New tests cover the default, a configured host and the URL.

Review: https://github.com/tlaplus/vscode-tlaplus/pull/544#pullrequestreview-5550237271
Signed-off-by: Guilherme Silva <239806034+NoneSilva@users.noreply.github.com>
